msgid "To do so, we could select three Citizen Soldiers and right-click on the stone quarry on the west of the Civic Center (the cursor changes when hovering the stone quarry while your soldiers are selected). However, these soldiers were gathering wood, so they may still carry some wood which would be lost when starting to gather another resource."
